---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="ERP Automation | AuditVerse AI"
  description="ERP automation: Odoo, SAP Business One and Oracle NetSuite implementation, integration and automation."
  canonical="https://www.auditverseai.com/erp-automation"
  activePage="erp-automation"
>

<section class="page-hero on-dark">
  <div class="hero-grid-lines"></div>
  <div class="wrap" style="position:relative;z-index:2;">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>ERP Automation</span></div>
    <div class="eyebrow">ERP Automation</div>
    <h1 style="font-size:clamp(32px,4.6vw,54px);font-weight:800;max-width:820px;line-height:1.1;">ERP Automation: one connected system instead of twelve spreadsheets</h1>
    <p class="lede" style="margin-top:20px;">We implement, integrate and automate Odoo, SAP Business One and Oracle NetSuite — turning your ERP from a data-entry chore into a self-updating source of truth.</p>
    <div class="badge-row" style="margin-top:26px;"><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Odoo</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>SAP Business One</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Oracle NetSuite</span><span class="chip"><span class="dot"></span>Custom Integrations</span></div>
    
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap two-col">
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">Implementation + Automation</div>
      <h2 class="headline">ERP that updates itself, not one your team has to feed</h2>
      <p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">A traditional ERP rollout stops at 'go-live' — your team still keys in every invoice, every stock movement, every payroll entry by hand. We go further: every module we implement ships with the AI Bots that keep it running with minimal manual touch.</p><p class="lede" style="margin-top:14px;">Whether you're standing up Odoo from scratch or automating an existing SAP or NetSuite instance, our approach is the same — map the process, design the control, automate the repetition.</p>
      <ul class="list-check" style="margin-top:24px;"><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Certified Odoo, SAP Business One and NetSuite implementation partners</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Pre-built connectors for invoice, payroll and procurement automation</li><li><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg> Multi-entity, multi-currency and multi-warehouse configurations</li></ul>
    </div>
    <div class="img-frame reveal">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1553877522-43269d4ea984?q=80&w=1200&auto=format&fit=crop" alt="ERP Automation: one connected system instead of twelve spreadsheets" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Capabilities</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Explore what we automate</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="tabs-nav" data-group="erp-automation"><button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="odoo">Odoo Automation</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="enterprise">SAP &amp; NetSuite</button><button class="tab-btn " data-tab="modules">Automated Modules</button></div>
    
      <div class="tab-panel active" data-group="erp-automation" data-tab="odoo">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="3" y="3" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><rect x="15" y="15" width="6" height="6" rx="1"/><path d="M9 6h6a3 3 0 0 1 3 3v6"/></svg></div><h4>Odoo Implementation</h4><p>Full-scope Odoo rollout across Accounting, Inventory, Sales, Purchase and Manufacturing modules.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v3"/><path d="M15 2v3"/><path d="M9 19v3"/><path d="M15 19v3"/><path d="M2 9h3"/><path d="M2 15h3"/><path d="M19 9h3"/><path d="M19 15h3"/></svg></div><h4>Custom Odoo Modules</h4><p>Bespoke modules for industry-specific workflows Odoo doesn't cover out of the box.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 7V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2"/><path d="M17 3h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v2"/><path d="M21 17v2a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2"/><path d="M7 21H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-2"/><path d="M7 12h10"/></svg></div><h4>Odoo + AI Bots</h4><p>Layer our Invoice AI and Approval AI directly on top of your Odoo instance.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="erp-automation" data-tab="enterprise">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="2" width="16" height="20"/><path d="M9 22v-4h6v4"/><path d="M9 6h1"/><path d="M14 6h1"/><path d="M9 10h1"/><path d="M14 10h1"/><path d="M9 14h1"/><path d="M14 14h1"/></svg></div><h4>SAP Business One</h4><p>Configuration, migration and automation for mid-market manufacturing and trading groups.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 1 0 18"/><path d="M12 3a15 15 0 0 0 0 18"/></svg></div><h4>Oracle NetSuite</h4><p>Multi-entity, multi-currency NetSuite rollouts with automated intercompany eliminations.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m12 2 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 17 9 5 9-5"/></svg></div><h4>Legacy System Bridging</h4><p>API and RPA connectors that bring legacy or custom-built systems into your automated ecosystem.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
      <div class="tab-panel " data-group="erp-automation" data-tab="modules">
        
          <div class="grid grid-3">
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Finance &amp; Accounting</h4><p>Automated journal posting, multi-currency revaluation and intercompany reconciliation.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H7a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="10" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.9"/><path d="M16 3.1a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.8"/></svg></div><h4>HR &amp; Payroll</h4><p>Employee lifecycle, attendance and payroll processing tied directly into your ledger.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="1" y="6" width="14" height="11"/><path d="M15 9h4l3 4v4h-7"/><circle cx="6" cy="19" r="2"/><circle cx="17" cy="19" r="2"/></svg></div><h4>Logistics &amp; Fleet</h4><p>Automated dispatch, route costing and fleet maintenance scheduling.</p></div>
            <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m16.5 9.4-9-5.19"/><path d="M21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73l7 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16Z"/><path d="M3.3 7 12 12l8.7-5"/><path d="M12 22V12"/></svg></div><h4>Procurement &amp; Inventory</h4><p>Automated reorder points, vendor scorecards and 3-way invoice matching.</p></div>
          </div>
      </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Benefits</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Why this matters for your bottom line</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-4">
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 3"/></svg></div><h4>Faster Month-End Close</h4><p>Automated reconciliations and intercompany eliminations cut close time from weeks to days.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>Single Source of Truth</h4><p>Every department reports from the same live ERP data — no more competing spreadsheets.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="1" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/></svg></div><h4>Fewer Data Entry Errors</h4><p>Automated postings remove the manual re-keying that causes most reconciliation breaks.</p></div>
    
      <div class="card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="m12 2 9 5-9 5-9-5Z"/><path d="m3 12 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 17 9 5 9-5"/></svg></div><h4>Scales With You</h4><p>Add entities, warehouses or currencies without re-architecting the system.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px;">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">How We Deliver</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Our engagement process</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="timeline reveal">
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 01</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">ERP Assessment</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">We audit your current system (or lack of one) and recommend Odoo, SAP or NetSuite based on your scale and industry.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 02</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Configuration &amp; Migration</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Chart of accounts, master data and historical transactions are migrated with full reconciliation sign-off.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 03</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Automation Layer</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">AI Bots are configured for invoicing, approvals, payroll and procurement specific to your workflows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 04</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">User Training</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">Hands-on training for your finance, operations and warehouse teams on the new automated system.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="timeline-item reveal">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:6px;">Step 05</div>
        <h3 class="subhead" style="margin-bottom:8px;">Post Go-Live Support</h3>
        <p class="lede" style="max-width:640px;">30/60/90-day hypercare followed by ongoing automation tuning.</p>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head  reveal">
      <div>
        <div class="eyebrow">Related Services</div>
        <h2 class="headline">Pairs well with</h2>
        
      </div>
      
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-3">
      <a href="/ai-automation" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><rect x="4" y="9" width="16" height="11" rx="2"/><path d="M12 9V5"/><circle cx="12" cy="3" r="1.4" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="9" cy="14.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><circle cx="15" cy="14.5" r="1.2" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"/><path d="M2 13h2"/><path d="M20 13h2"/></svg></div><h4>AI Automation</h4><p>Add finance, HR and procurement bots on top of your ERP.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/accounting-bookkeeping" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M4 2h16v20l-3-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-2-2-2 2-3-2Z"/><path d="M8 7h8"/><path d="M8 11h8"/><path d="M8 15h5"/></svg></div><h4>Accounting &amp; Bookkeeping</h4><p>Keep your books audit-ready inside the new system.</p></a>
    
      <a href="/bi-dashboards" class="card card reveal"><div class="icon-box"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M3 3v18h18"/><rect x="7" y="12" width="3" height="6"/><rect x="12" y="8" width="3" height="10"/><rect x="17" y="5" width="3" height="13"/></svg></div><h4>BI Dashboards</h4><p>Turn ERP data into live executive dashboards.</p></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section on-dark">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:840px;">
    <div class="section-head center">
      <div class="eyebrow center" style="justify-content:center;">FAQ</div>
      <h2 class="headline">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="reveal">
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Do we need to replace our current ERP entirely? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Not always. In many engagements we automate around your existing system using API and RPA bridges before recommending a full migration.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">How disruptive is an ERP migration? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>We run parallel environments and phase cutovers by module or entity, so day-to-day operations continue uninterrupted.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="acc-item">
        <div class="acc-q">Can you support multi-country operations? <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M12 5v14"/><path d="M5 12h14"/></svg></div>
        <div class="acc-a"><p>Yes — multi-entity, multi-currency and localised tax configuration (including VAT and ZATCA) is standard in our implementations.</p></div>
      </div></div>
  </div>
</section>


<section class="section-tight on-dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="cta-band reveal">
      <h2 class="headline center" style="max-width:640px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Ready to put ERP Automation to work?</h2>
      <p class="lede center" style="margin-top:16px;position:relative;z-index:1;">Book a free consultation and get a tailored automation roadmap within 5 business days.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions center" style="justify-content:center;position:relative;z-index:1;">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Book Free Consultation <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class=""><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-outline">Schedule Demo</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>
